#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:3
msgid "Inception：多尺度工具"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:5
msgid "多尺度工具——一种冰镐打不了所有岩壁，同时备好放大镜和广角镜。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`alexnet` 用 11×11 的大卷积核首登了 ImageNet。一种冰镐打天下——太粗暴了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:9
msgid ""
"有的岩壁是裂缝（细粒度），有的是悬崖（全局结构）。**一种冰镐，打不了所有的岩壁。** 但传统 CNN "
"有一个隐藏假设：所有特征都需要相同大小的感受野。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:11
msgid "仔细想想，这个假设并不成立："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:13
msgid "识别一只蚂蚁，只需要看局部几个像素（小感受野）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:14
msgid "识别一头大象，需要看到整个身体结构（大感受野）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:15
msgid "一张图片里可能同时有蚂蚁和大象"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`receptive-"
"field`告诉我们，感受野随深度增加而扩大。但问题是——**每一层只有一个固定大小的感受野**。如果第3层的感受野是 5×5，那它就只看 5×5"
" 的区域，不管这个区域里的是蚂蚁还是大象。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:19
msgid "能不能让网络**同时拥有多个大小的感受野**，然后自己选择用哪个？这就是 Inception 的核心洞察。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:21
msgid "固定感受野的困境"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:23
msgid "想象你在看一张照片："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:25
msgid "用放大镜（小感受野）：能看清蚂蚁的触角细节，但看不到大象的全貌"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:26
msgid "用广角镜（大感受野）：能看到大象的轮廓，但蚂蚁只是一个模糊的点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:28
msgid "传统的 CNN 就像一台固定焦距的相机——要么一直用放大镜，要么一直用广角镜。无论哪种选择，都会丢失另一种尺度的信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:30
msgid "从信息论的角度看，这就是**信息瓶颈**问题："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:32
msgid "小卷积核（3×3）：丢失了大于 3×3 的结构信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:33
msgid "大卷积核（5×5或更大）：丢失了精细的空间细节，还增加参数量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:35
msgid "有没有办法**同时保留不同尺度的信息**？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:37
msgid "Inception 的解决方案：多分支并行"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Inception（GoogLeNet）{cite}`szegedy2015going` 的解决方案非常直接：**不要选择，全都要**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:41
msgid "在每个 Inception 模块中，输入同时通过多个分支处理："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:61
msgid "**四个分支并行工作**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "分支"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "卷积核"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:251
msgid "感受野"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "捕捉什么"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "1×1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "逐像素的精细特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "3×3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "局部边缘、纹理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "5×5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "更大的部件结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "池化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "可变"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:43
msgid "平滑后的显著特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:70
msgid "最后把四个分支的输出**在通道维度拼接**——相当于同时保留了四种\"焦距\"的信息，让网络自己学习什么时候用哪个。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:72
msgid "1×1 卷积的智慧：降维与信息压缩"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:74
msgid "如果你细心算一下参数量，会发现一个问题："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:76
msgid "输入：256 通道"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:77
msgid "3×3 卷积输出 256 通道：参数量 = 256 × (3×3×256) ≈ 590K"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:78
msgid "5×5 卷积输出 256 通道：参数量 = 256 × (5×5×256) ≈ 1.6M"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:80
msgid "四个分支加起来，参数量爆炸了！"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:82
msgid "Inception 的第二个洞察：**先用 1×1 卷积降维，再上大卷积核**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:102
msgid "**1×1 卷积的作用**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:104
msgid "**降维**：256 通道 → 64/96/16 通道，大幅减少后续计算"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:105
msgid "**跨通道信息融合**：每个 1×1 卷积核看所有通道，学习通道间的组合关系"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:106
msgid "**增加非线性**：1×1 卷积后接 ReLU，在不增加感受野的情况下提升表达能力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:108
msgid "这个设计后来被许多后续架构采用，成为**降维与特征融合**的标准技巧。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:110
msgid "信息论视角——为什么要\"全都要\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:112
msgid "为什么 Inception 坚持\"不要选择，全都要\"？这背后有一个深层的信息论原理。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:114
msgid "从\"筛子\"说起"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:116
msgid "想象你有一堆混合的沙子、石子和石块，需要把它们分类："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:118
msgid "**小筛子**：能筛出细沙，但石子和石块都留在上面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:119
msgid "**大筛子**：能筛出细沙和石子，但石块留在上面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:120
msgid "**无论用哪种筛子，你都会漏掉一些东西**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:122
msgid "卷积核就像筛子："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:124
msgid "**小卷积核（3×3）**：只捕捉局部细节（纹理、边缘），看不到更大结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:125
msgid "**大卷积核（5×5）**：能捕捉更大结构，但会模糊掉细节"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:127
msgid "图像中的\"频率\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:129
msgid "图像里其实藏着不同\"粗细\"的信息："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "信息类型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "类比"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "用什么捕捉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "**细节**（高频）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "蚂蚁的触角、树叶的脉络"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "小感受野（3×3）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "**局部结构**（中频）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "车轮、窗户、眼睛"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "中等感受野（5×5）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "**整体布局**（低频）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "天空、草地、建筑物的轮廓"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:84
msgid "大感受野或池化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:137
msgid "**关键洞察**：如果只用一种卷积核，就像只用一种筛子——总会漏掉某些信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:139
msgid "Inception 的信息保留策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:141
msgid "Inception 的多分支设计，相当于**同时用多个筛子筛选**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:143
msgid "小卷积核保留细节信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:144
msgid "中等卷积核保留局部结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:145
msgid "大卷积核保留整体布局"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:146
msgid "最后把所有结果拼在一起——**没有信息被丢弃**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:148
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"用更专业的术语说，这就是**最大化输入与输出的互信息**——让网络尽可能多地保留原始图像的信息（这一概念将在 {doc}`../model-"
"architecture-design/part1-intro` "
"中详细展开）。单分支会\"丢失\"某些尺度的信息，而多分支确保了**每个尺度都有专门的通道来处理**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:150
msgid "为什么这比单分支更好？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:152
msgid "假设图片里有一只猫："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:154
msgid "只看**胡须细节**（小卷积核）：你知道这里有东西，但不知道是什么"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:155
msgid "只看**整体轮廓**（大卷积核）：你知道这是一个动物，但看不清细节"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:156
msgid "**两者结合**：你同时知道\"这是猫\"（轮廓）和\"猫有胡须\"（细节）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:158
msgid "Inception 让网络**同时掌握多个尺度的信息**，就像人眼看东西时既看到整体又看清细节一样。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:160
msgid "历史背景：2014 年的突破"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:162
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Inception（GoogLeNet）由 Google 团队于 2014 年提出{cite}`szegedy2015going`，是 "
"ImageNet 2014 的冠军："
msgstr ""

