msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:172
msgid "局限与演进"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:174
msgid "Inception 虽然强大，但也有一些局限："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:176
msgid "**结构复杂**：需要手工设计每个分支的通道数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:177
msgid "**超参数多**：降维到多少通道？几个分支？需要反复实验"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:178
msgid "**训练困难**：22 层在当时已经是深层网络，优化有挑战"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:180
msgid "这些挑战促使研究者探索**更简洁高效**的设计。但 Inception 的核心思想——**多尺度处理**——从未过时，而是以新的形式不断演进："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:182
msgid "**空洞卷积（Atrous Convolution）**：不增加参数就能扩大感受野，是 Inception 多尺度思想的另一种实现"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:183
msgid "**EfficientNet**：复合缩放（深度、宽度、分辨率）+ 移动版 Inception 模块"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:184
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**RFB Net** {cite}`liu2018receptive`：用空洞卷积模拟人类视觉皮层的感受野结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:186
msgid "RFB Net：向生物视觉学习"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:188
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"RFB（Receptive Field Block）Net {cite}`liu2018receptive` 是 Inception "
"思想的延伸，但更进一步——它不只是\"多个固定大小\"，而是**模拟人类视觉皮层的感受野分布**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:190
msgid "人类视觉有个特点："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:192
msgid "**中央凹（fovea）**：视野中心，感受野小、密度高、分辨率精细"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:193
msgid "**周边视觉**：视野边缘，感受野大、密度低、分辨率粗糙"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:195
msgid "空洞卷积：不增加参数就能看更远"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:198
msgid ""
"在介绍 RFB 之前，我们需要先理解**空洞卷积（Dilated/Atrous "
"Convolution）**——一种在不增加参数量的情况下扩大感受野的技术。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:200
msgid "**核心思想**：在卷积核的像素之间插入\"空洞\"（零），让卷积核能覆盖更大的区域，而实际的参数量不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:239
msgid "**普通 3×3 卷积**：看 3×3 = 9 个像素，感受野 3×3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/inception.md:240
